L["Outline color around each quest card. Only used while Row Layout is set to Card."] = "任務卡片邊框描邊顏色，僅行布局設為卡片模式生效。"
L["How thick the card outline is, in pixels. 0 hides the outline and leaves just the fill."] = "卡片邊框像素粗細，填0只保留填充色，隱藏邊框線。"
